#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"<strong>Consent:</strong> for optional communications, cookies or other "
"processing where consent is required. You may withdraw consent at any time."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Consentimiento:</strong> para comunicaciones opcionales, cookies u "
"otros tratamientos que requieran consentimiento. Puedes retirarlo en "
"cualquier momento."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"<strong>Contract:</strong> to take requested steps or provide services under"
" an agreement."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Contrato:</strong> para realizar acciones solicitadas o prestar "
"servicios bajo un acuerdo."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"<strong>Hong Kong:</strong> individuals have rights of access and correction"
" under the Personal Data (Privacy) Ordinance. Other rights may apply based "
"on the law governing the relevant processing."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Hong Kong:</strong> las personas tienen derechos de acceso y "
"corrección según la Ordenanza de Datos Personales (Privacidad). Otros "
"derechos pueden aplicar según la ley que rija el tratamiento."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"<strong>Legal obligation:</strong> to meet applicable accounting, tax, "
"compliance, regulatory or law-enforcement duties."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Obligación legal:</strong> para cumplir obligaciones contables, "
"fiscales, normativas y legales aplicables."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"<strong>Legitimate interests:</strong> to operate a secure B2B partner "
"platform, manage relationships, improve services and protect our business, "
"balanced against your rights."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Intereses legítimos:</strong> para operar una plataforma B2B segura,"
" gestionar relaciones, mejorar servicios y proteger el negocio, ponderando "
"tus derechos."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"Account and support information, such as login identifier, password stored "
"in protected form, verification status, enquiries and support records."
msgstr ""
"Datos de cuenta y soporte, como identificador de acceso, contraseña "
"protegida, estado de verificación, consultas y registros de asistencia."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_terms
msgid ""
"Approval to use the Hub does not by itself appoint you as a distributor, "
"agent, representative, franchisee or exclusive partner, and does not create "
"a partnership, joint venture, fiduciary or employment relationship. Any such"
" relationship must be set out in a separate written agreement signed by "
"authorised representatives."
msgstr ""
"La aprobación de acceso no te designa por sí sola distribuidor, agente, "
"representante, franquiciado ni socio exclusivo, ni crea una sociedad, "
"empresa conjunta, relación fiduciaria o laboral. Cualquier relación de este "
"tipo debe constar en un acuerdo escrito separado firmado por representantes "
"autorizados."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"Because we work with partners and service providers internationally, "
"personal data may be accessed or processed outside your country or region. "
"Privacy laws in those locations may differ."
msgstr ""
"Al trabajar internacionalmente con socios y proveedores, los datos pueden "
"consultarse o tratarse fuera de tu país o región. Las leyes de privacidad de"
" esos lugares pueden ser diferentes."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_terms
msgid ""
"Before starting formal proceedings, each party should first attempt in good "
"faith to resolve the dispute through written notice and reasonable business "
"discussions."
msgstr ""
"Antes de iniciar procedimientos formales, cada parte debe intentar de buena "
"fe resolver la controversia mediante notificación escrita y conversaciones "
"comerciales razonables."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
