msgstr ""
"Datos de contacto profesional, como correo de trabajo, teléfono de empresa, "
"móvil o WhatsApp, país o región y sitio web."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_terms
msgid ""
"By creating an account, clicking to accept these Terms, or using the Hub, "
"you confirm that you have read and agree to these Terms and our"
msgstr ""
"Al crear una cuenta, aceptar estos términos o utilizar el portal, confirmas "
"que has leído y aceptas estos términos y nuestra"

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"Depending on applicable law, you may have the right to request access to "
"personal data, correction of inaccurate data, deletion, restriction or "
"objection to processing, withdrawal of consent, or a portable copy. You may "
"also have the right to complain to a competent privacy regulator."
msgstr ""
